title: Activist_Act1
---
Activist: Pst.
Activist: Hey.
Activist: Hey you.
Activist: You like this place right? 
Activist: The Company, they want the owner to sell it to them.
Activist: Last I heard the owner was leaning towards the buyout.
Activist: That can't happen. They'd make everything more expensive, ice out all the normal people to make way for the elite.
Activist: Skiing should be for everyone!
Activist: Not to mention the environmental impact they would do on this place.
Activist: I want to save it. Would you want to help?
-> Yes! Absolutely!
    Activist: Great! Thank god!
    Activist: There should be some clues out there that would convince the owner to change her mind.
    Activist: Maybe try talking to people, they might know something.
-> I don't know...
    Activist: That's alright. I don't want to pressure you.
    Activist: If you change your mind though, I would apprieciate the help.
===

title: Activist_Act2
---
Activist: I've overheard some people talking about a recording.
Activist: Something about some guy talking about the landscaping they'd do.
Activist: I've been trying to find it on the trails, but I've had no luck.
Activist: Maybe you can help me out? 
===

title: Activist_Act3
---
Activist: Hey get this: there's a flash drive somewhere around here.
Activist: Apparently, the designer employee dropped it.
Activist: I'd say, there would be some freaky company advertising on there.
Activist: We have to find it!
===

title: Activist_Act4
---
Activist: Hey you!
Activist: I wanted to thank you for you help with all this.
Activist: I feel bad, you did all the work.
Activist: Either way, now, we and everyone else gets to enjoy skiing.
Activist: Skiing is for everyone! It's the community that makes it special!
Activist: Thank you!
===
